        <text x='150' y='426' fontSize='12' fill='#6B7280' text-anchor='middle'>既有工具链</text>
        <line x1='300' y1='140' x2='470' y2='140' stroke='#185FA5' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='480' y='132' fontFamily='JetBrains Mono' fontSize='13' fill='#185FA5'>sbt sourceGenerators</text>
        <text x='480' y='156' fontSize='12' fill='#6B7280'>.p4 保存即重新生成</text>
        <text x='480' y='200' fontSize='13' fill='#6B7280'>生成包名 p4cgen</text>
